<div xmlns:perseus="http://www.perseus.org/meta/perseus.rdfs#" xmlns:dctype="http://purl.org/dc/dcmitype/" xmlns:tufts="http://www.tufts.edu/" xmlns:alph="http://alpheios.net/namespaces/tei" class="alpheios-lex-text_container en">
    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n27735" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">δίψ-ιος</span></b> , <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">α</span>, <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ον</span>, also <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ος</span>, <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ον</span>
		<i><span class="en">
			A.
			<u>Ch.</u>
			185
		</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
			Nic.
			<u>Th.</u>
			147
		</span></i>: (<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">δίψα</span>):—<div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>thirsty,</i> and of things,
				<i>dry, parched,</i>
			
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">δ. κόνις</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					A.
					<u>Ag.</u>
					495
				</span></i>
			, <i><span class="en">
				S.
				<u>Ant.</u>
				246
			</span></i>; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">χθών</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					E.
					<u>Alc.</u>
					560
				</span></i>
			; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">πῦρ θεοῦ</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Id.
					<u>Rh.</u>
					417
				</span></i>
			; <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἐξ ὀμμάτων δὲ δίψιοι πίπτουσι
				σταγόνες,</span> perh. tears <i>checked in their flow,</i>
			<i><span class="en">
				A.
				<u>Ch.</u>
				185
			</span></i>; <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">δίψιον,</span> expld. by <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">βεβλαμμένον,</span>
			<i><span class="en">
				S.
				<u>Fr.</u>
				296
			</span></i>, by <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">βλαπτικόν,</span>
			<i><span class="en">
				Hsch.
			</span></i>; cf. <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">δῖψαι.</span>
		</div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense2"><b>II.</b>
			<i>causing thirst,</i>
			
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ὕδατα</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Hermipp.
				</span></i>
			 ap. <i><span class="en">
				J.
				<u>Ap.</u>
				1.22
			</span></i>; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">δ. σήψ</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Nic.
					<u>Th.</u>
					147
				</span></i>
			; cf. 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">διψάς</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					11
				</span></i>
			.</div>
